# VoltTrace Technical Documentation

Welcome to the technical documentation directory for **VoltTrace: Edge-Powered Smart Plug Platform with Embedded Physical AI**.

This folder contains detailed technical reference guides covering hardware interfaces, dual-core firmware architecture, machine learning model specifications, and API endpoints.

