   * Random Forest classification boundaries for Resistive, Inductive, and Non-Linear SMPS loads.
   * Autoencoder Reconstruction Error (MSE) & Universal Health Scoring ($0\% - 100\%$).

4. **[FastAPI Web Server & API Spec](./API_DOCUMENTATION.md)**
   * Telemetry REST API schema (`/api/telemetry`).
   * Fingerprint lock/unlock POST endpoint parameters.

